WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:02.999
Your virtual cards, each on the OnGem card face

2
00:00:03.001 --> 00:00:05.228
Open a card

3
00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:09.877
Freeze it in one tap

4
00:00:09.879 --> 00:00:15.309
Unfreeze it when you are ready

5
00:00:15.345 --> 00:00:19.991
Card details open in the bank’s secure window; OnGem never sees the number

6
00:00:19.993 --> 00:00:22.604
The window closes by itself after a few minutes
